  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h1> Presetting &amp; Measuring with »reamCheck« </h1>",
   "body": "<p>With »reamCheck«, you can fully automatically, quickly, with repeatable accuracy, and user-independent adjust complete machining tools—such as long reamers and fine boring tools—to meet the required safety standards. The integrated control measurement provides the safety you need. </p> <p>The tailstock can be conveniently lowered using the control handle and holds long, slender tools exactly in position with a defined contact force. Thanks to ZOLLER’s outstanding technology, you can carry out all steps with ease and absolute process reliability. Whether you prefer to use a tactile measurement method during the setup process or use the proven ZOLLER image processing technology »“pilot«” is entirely up to you. </p> <p>One thing is certain: It doesn’t get any better than this!</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/company/contact\">Inquire now</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/3/csm_reamcheck_detail_f4a6271a9a.webp",
